# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Weight-Tracker — the public GitHub Pages app (index.html ships).
# Defensive: no secrets or local data should ever land here.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Credentials / secrets ──
*.env
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
id_rsa*
.mcp.json
pb.env
anthropic.key
*token*.txt
pb_token.txt
*secret*
*credential*

# ── Local data / dumps (should never be in the app repo) ──
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.sql
*.dump
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db

# ── Dependencies ──
node_modules/

# ── OS / editor cruft ──
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~

# NOTE: index.html IS the deployable app and is intentionally tracked.
# The `Authorization: "Bearer " + c.token` in it is app code using a
# user-supplied token at runtime — not an embedded secret.
.build/

